# 2. Requirement Analysis Phase
**Project Name:** ComicVerse AI

## Functional Requirements
* **Input Form Interface:** Clean HTML/CSS input fields for user prompt, character name, setting, story tone, and art style choices[span_0](start_span)[span_0](end_span).
* **Comic Script Generation:** Integration with Google Gemini Flash for generating comic outlines and Gemini Pro for full panel narrations and dialogues[span_1](start_span)[span_1](end_span).
* **Image Generation Engine:** Panel-wise comic illustration generation using Hugging Face Diffusers (Stable Diffusion)[span_2](start_span)[span_2](end_span).
* **Live Web Preview:** Interactive preview page (`comic_preview.html`) displaying panel titles, generated images, and dialogues in sequence[span_3](start_span)[span_3](end_span).
* **PDF Export Engine:** Compilation of images and story text into structured PDF documents using FPDF (`exporters.py`)[span_4](start_span)[span_4](end_span).

## Non-Functional Requirements
* **Performance:** Rapid processing pipeline leveraging optimized API calls for story generation and GPU acceleration for image rendering[span_5](start_span)[span_5](end_span).
* **Usability:** Intuitive interface requiring no prior artistic or technical skills from end users[span_6](start_span)[span_6](end_span).
* **Scalability:** Modular FastAPI backend allowing independent updates to AI model pipelines and exporter components[span_7](start_span)[span_7](end_span).

